        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Something amazing has appeared in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Wales",
            "zh": "威尔士"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "! In a place called Llwyn-On Reservoir near Merthyr Tydfil, an old bridge can now be seen. A "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "reservoir",
            "zh": "水库"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is a man-made lake that "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stores",
            "ref": "v-store"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " water for people to use. The bridge was built before the lake was made, so it is "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "usually",
            "ref": "v-usually"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " deep under the water."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This year, the weather in Wales has been very dry. From February to April, the country got only about 59% of its "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "normal",
            "ref": "v-normal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " rainfall. Because of this, the water level dropped lower and lower. As the water went down, the bridge slowly came into "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "view",
            "zh": "映入眼帘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " again."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The bridge "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "last",
            "zh": "上次"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " appeared in 2022 during another dry "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "spell",
            "zh": "干旱期"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "local",
            "ref": "v-local"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people have come to see it. Some take photos, while others walk close to it carefully."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The bridge "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reminds",
            "ref": "v-remind"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people how weather can change our world."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
